# Pagination Builder — Cursor-Based + URL State

## AUTO-DETECT TRIGGERS
- Lists with potentially >50 items (quiz responses, analytics tables)
- User mentions: pagination, load more, next page, cursor, infinite scroll
- IndexTable or DataTable with large dataset
