## DECISION TREE
```
Need pagination? →
  Admin list (quizzes, questions)? → Polaris Pagination with URL search params
  Analytics table (responses, events)? → Cursor-based with Prisma cursor
  Mobile / storefront? → Infinite scroll / Load More button
  Large dataset (>10k rows)? → Cursor pagination ONLY — never offset
  Server query → Prisma cursor pattern with take + cursor + skip:1
