- [ ] `ORDERS_CREATE` webhook registered in shopify.app.toml
- [ ] All three attribution strategies implemented (attribute, cart token, email)
- [ ] Upsert used (not create) to prevent duplicate attribution on retry
- [ ] Attribution window configurable (not hardcoded)
- [ ] Revenue queries scoped to shop always
