## NEVER
- Never attribute an order to multiple quizzes (use upsert with do-nothing on update)
- Never fail the webhook handler due to attribution errors
- Never query revenue without scoping to shop
- Never use email matching as primary strategy (too imprecise — use cart token first)
- Never store order total as string in DB (use float for aggregation)
