# Audit Log Builder — Admin Action Tracking

## AUTO-DETECT TRIGGERS
- User mentions: audit log, activity log, change history, who changed, when changed
- Admin needs to see what actions were taken in the app
- Compliance requirement for tracking data changes
- Debugging: "when was this quiz last modified?"

## DECISION TREE
```
Need audit logging? →
  What to log? →
    All admin actions? → Middleware wrapper on all actions
    Specific operations? → Log at point of operation
  What data? → actor, action, resource, resourceId, changes, timestamp, ip
  Storage? → AuditLog table (90-day retention)
  Display? → Activity feed in admin settings page
  Filter? → By action type, resource, date range
```

