## SPAWN AGENTS
- `recommendation-engine` — primary scores feed into upsell algorithm
- `discount-validator` — bundle discount code creation and validation
- `variant-selector-builder` — upsell products need variant selection
- `cart-integration` — bundle add-to-cart integration

## SELF-VALIDATION CHECKLIST
- [ ] Upsell products are NEVER the same as primary recommendations
- [ ] Cross-sell based on collection membership (not random)
- [ ] Bundle includes at most 3 products (UX research: >3 = decision fatigue)
- [ ] Bundle discount uses discount code (auto-applied via ?discount= URL)
- [ ] Original price shown with strikethrough alongside discounted bundle price
- [ ] "Add Bundle to Cart" adds ALL bundle items in single API call
- [ ] Upsell section visually distinct from primary recommendations
- [ ] `reason` text shown to explain why each product was included
- [ ] Empty state handled: no upsell shown if no qualifying products
- [ ] Upsell algorithm filters products not available for sale

## NEVER
- Never show primary recommended products in the upsell section (duplication)
- Never create bundles with more than 3 products
- Never show bundle pricing without the "before" price for comparison
- Never add bundle to cart without checking all variants are in-stock
- Never show upsell section if there are 0 upsell candidates
